Z||000005||Slammed Fiero||01-31-2001||09:16 PM||||Starter is on the wrong side , the motor is expensive to make big power , but weighs just 320lbs COMPLETE!<P>Enjoy .here's mine in a 66 corvair. , you may want to try and look up Kennedy engineering they made my adaptor. <P>[IMGhttp://home.ican.net/~blur/v8e.gif[/IMG]<P>I have 2 motors in the garage (plus the one in the car) Would be very nice  in a mg midget. killer autocrosser.<P><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan M McCreery<BR>86 GT<BR>New Custom White face gauges 17" Tr motorsports Typhoons Ground Control coil overs , Big bars front and rear , Mustang scoop , accel coil , no cat , 4spd , short shift , poly dog bone and bushings momo pedals and shift knob , round headlight conversion , Geni stainless steel oval exhaust tips. Pioneer 6000 CD player , Sony Mobile Amp. Currently doing big brake conversion...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/jssig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Slammed Fiero||01-31-2001||09:18 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://home.ican.net/~blur/v8e.gif"> <P>They made anywhere from 160 to 200hp , you could get turbo motors , the buick motor is better because of the heads , the olds block is stronger. The motor in our vair puts out 290 N/A Hp (dynoed) and it is far from stock.<P>good luck<P><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan M McCreery<BR>86 GT<BR>New Custom White face gauges 17" Tr motorsports Typhoons Ground Control coil overs , Big bars front and rear , Mustang scoop , accel coil , no cat , 4spd , short shift , poly dog bone and bushings momo pedals and shift knob , round headlight conversion , Geni stainless steel oval exhaust tips. Pioneer 6000 CD player , Sony Mobile Amp. Currently doing big brake conversion...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/jssig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
